  "introduction": "DUA JAWSHAN AL SAGIR\n\nThe Supplication of the Minor Chain-Armor.\n\nThe commentary on this supplicatory prayer in the most reliable books of supplications has been more elaborate than the commentary mentioned for the supplicatory prayer of al-Jawshan al-Kabir. As a footnote, al-Kaf’ami, in al-Balad al-Amin, says, “This excellent supplicatory prayer is highly considered. It was said by Imam Musa al-Kazim (a.s.) when al-Hadi, the ‘Abbasid ruler, intended to assassin him. Hence, the Imam (a.s.) saw in dream his grandfather, the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.), who foretold that Almighty Allah would annihilate his enemy.”\n\nIt is also recorded in Sayyid Ibn Tawus’s book of Muhaj al-Da’awat but with little difference. However, the following copy is quoted from al-Balad al-Amin:\n\nYou should then prostrate yourself and say the following:\n\nNow, you may mention the name of your enemy.",
  "versesCount": 439,
  "verses": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "arabic": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِیْمِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "arabic": "اِلٰهِىْ كَمْ مِنْ عَدُوٍّ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "arabic": "انْتَضٰى عَلَىَّ سَيْفَ عَدَاوَتِهِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "arabic": "وَشَحَذَ لِىْ ظُبَةَ مِدْيَتِهِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "arabic": "وَاَرْهَفَ لِىْ شَبَاحَدِّهِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "arabic": "وَدَافَ لِىْ قَوَاتِلَ سُمُوْمِهِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "arabic": "وَسَدَّدَ اِلَىَّ صَوَاۤئِبَ سِهَامِهِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "arabic": "وَلَمْ تَنَمْ عَنِّىْ عَيْنُ حِرَاسَتِهِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "arabic": "وَاَضْمَرَ اَنْ يَسُوْمَنِى الْمَكْرُوْهَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "arabic": "وَيُجَرِّعَنِّىْ ذُعَافَ مَرَارَتِهِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "arabic": "نَظَرْتَ اِلٰى ضَعْفِىْ عَنِ احْتِمَالِ الْفَوَادِحِ،",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "arabic": "وَعَجْزِىْ عَنِ الْاِنْتِصَارِ مِمَّنْ قَصَدَنِىْ بِمُحَارَبَتِهِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "arabic": "وَوَحْدَتِىْ فِىْ كَثِيْرٍ مِمَّنْ نَاوَانِىْ وَاَرْصَدَ لِىْ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "arabic": "فِيْمَا لَمْ اُعْمِلْ فِكْرِىْ فِى الْاِ رْصَادِ لَهُمْ بِمِثْلِهِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "arabic": "فَاَيَّدْتَنِىْ بِقُوَّتِكَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "arabic": "وَشَدَدْتَ اَزْرِىْ بِنُصْرَتِكَ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "arabic": "وَفَلَلْتَ لِىْ حَدَّهُ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "arabic": "وَخَذَلْتَهُ بَعْدَ جَمْعِ عَدِيْدِهِ وَحَشْدِهِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "arabic": "واَعْلَيْتَ كَعْبِىْ عَلَيْهِ،",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "arabic": "وَوَجَّهْتَ مَا سَدَّدَ اِلَىَّ مِنْ مَكَاۤئِدِهِ اِلَيْهِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "arabic": "وَرَدَدْتَهُ عَلَيْهِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "arabic": "وَلَمْ يَشْفِ غَلِيْلَهُ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "arabic": "وَلَمْ تَبْرُدْ حَزَازَاتُ غَيْظِهِ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "arabic": "وَقَدْ عَضَّ عَلَىَّ اَنَامِلَهُ",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
